cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived data, please cite the review and this deposit."
title: "Selection analysis of the glycosylation machinery and the Golgi control layer across TCGA"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data behind Figure 1 and Supplementary Figure S1 of
  "Tuning, not switching: the Golgi control layer as an analogue determinant
  of chemoresistance". dN/dS analysis of 2,096,036 somatic substitutions from
  10,168 TCGA tumours, testing four gene classes for positive selection,
  with detection-power calibration and per-tumour-type stratification.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-11-25   # update to the day you publish the release
